 "summary": "The post-PR surface is minimal and complete: general lemmas (`PowerSeries.coeff_mul_of_X_pow_dvd`, `Units.eq_inv_pow_mul_iff_pow_mul_eq`, the `coeff_*_subst` family) are public in Mathlib-shaped homes while only the multiplied-form helpers specific to the beta-function argument are `private`, each with a public solved-form counterpart. `SubstGroup` carries no free data, the characteristic API (`transformBeta_eq_iff`, `*_def`, `mem_ker_linearCoeff_iff`, the coefficient and cancellation lemmas) is usable without unfolding, and the `@[simp]` set is confluent with no compatibility artifacts.",
